  "title": "The surprising health benefits of dreaming",
  "author": "Matt Walker",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/matt_walker_the_surprising_health_benefits_of_dreaming",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T09:22:44.309613Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T09:22:44.309613Z",
  "lead_time": 13.283,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Why do we dream?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2141B96D9B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "Why do we dream? [Sleeping with Science] Well, we dream for at least several different reasons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D0394BD0F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "One key benefit is creativity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9EBF74383",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "Sleep, including dream sleep, is associated with an enhanced ability to solve next-day problems.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA888FC8C8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "almost as though we go to sleep with the pieces of the jigsaw, but we wake up with the puzzle complete",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A312F1BDE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "It's almost as though we go to sleep with the pieces of the jigsaw, but we wake up with the puzzle complete.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "265083EA68",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "The second benefit of REM-sleep dreaming is emotional first aid.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DC3F56E8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "takes the painful sting out of difficult emotional experiences",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9AF7F09335",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "REM sleep takes the painful sting out of difficult emotional experiences so that when we come back the next day, we feel better about those painful events.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC23CA80BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "dreaming as a form of overnight therapy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D5778F907",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "You can almost think of dreaming as a form of overnight therapy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "455CB3BF62",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "time that heals all wounds",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "739B431F92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "It's not time that heals all wounds, but it's time during dream sleep that provides emotional convalescence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00CC370739",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Now, it's not just that you dream.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00278E6F1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "It's also what you dream about",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "46168FA890",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "It's also what you dream about that seems to make a difference.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "88A996E9DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 233,
        "text": "Scientists have discovered that after learning a virtual maze, for example, those individuals who slept but critically also dreamed about the maze were the only ones who ended up being better at navigating the maze when they woke up.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8B2B21A7C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "And this same principle is true for our mental health.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91CF1E8D0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 254,
        "text": "For example, people going through a difficult or traumatic experience such as a divorce, and who are dreaming about that event, go on to gain resolution to their depression relative to those who were dreaming but not dreaming about the events themselves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3179FF135",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "All of which means that sleep and the very act of dreaming itself appears to be an essential ingredient to so much of our waking lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A63FA34441",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "We dream, therefore we are.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B2169594B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}